<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="container my-5" style="max-width: 800px;">
  <h2 class="fw-bold mb-4">Terms of Service & AirCover</h2>
  <div class="card border rounded-4 p-4 p-md-5 bg-white shadow-sm" style="line-height: 1.8;">
    <p>Welcome to <strong>Wanderlust</strong>. By using our platform as a guest or host, you agree to abide by these terms of service and community standards.</p>
    
    <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">1. Booking & Cancellation Terms</h5>
    <p class="text-secondary">Guests receive a full refund when cancelling reservations at least 48 hours prior to the check-in date. Long-stay discounts and booking availability are dynamically validated by our backend pricing engine.</p>

    <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">2. Host Standards & Property Accuracy</h5>
    <p class="text-secondary">Hosts must accurately represent their properties, amenities, and pricing. Listing owners retain full control over their properties and reservations.</p>

    <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">3. AirCover Guarantee</h5>
    <p class="text-secondary">Every booking made on Wanderlust is protected by our AirCover policy against host cancellations, check-in issues, and listing discrepancies.</p>
  </div>
</div>
